## Summary

The page concept is strong — the bank ticker, invite-only gating, and IB-specific scoring angle are all good. The issue is purely surface-level: the font stack, border-radius, and color choices are the exact same defaults that every AI tool spits out. Swap the fonts, sharpen the corners, warm up the grays, and it'll immediately stop reading as AI-generated.

